        - Make formatLocalizedString() an implementation detail of
          WEB_UI_FORMAT_[CF]STRING() macros.

        * platform/LocalizedStrings.h:
        (WEB_UI_STRING): Add.
        (WEB_UI_STRING_KEY): Add.
